    {
      "heading": "Muggle changes the gold race",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-16-0558-arc-2-muggle-enters-gold"
      ],
      "text": "Muggle has climbed into the ARC-AGI-2 public board’s provisional gold places, reaching fourteenth at 59.17 after a 17.09-point gain. Another challenger has cleared the gold line, which rises from 55.00 to 57.08 overnight."
    },
    {
      "heading": "A brief foothold for masspeaks",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-16-0358-arc-2-masspeaks-enters-gold",
        "wire-2026-10-15-2003-arc-2-gold-line-rises-to-55"
      ],
      "text": "masspeaks reached fifteenth at 55.00 in the overnight wire, but closes sixteenth with that score. ARCward Intelligence now occupies the last of the fifteen provisional gold places at 57.08, leaving masspeaks 2.08 points short. That is how quickly a boundary result can change without the displaced team losing score. Tufa Labs still leads at 88.06, ahead of Yi-Chia Chen at 83.89 and rabbithole at 80.56; all three are unchanged."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Movement beyond the medal edge",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-15-1801-arc-2-ibyyue-extends-arc-2-gold-run",
        "wire-2026-10-16-0000-arc-2-mtg-climbs-to-twenty-second"
      ],
      "text": "Enes Kulak adds 7.92 points to reach twentieth at 52.78, while 大阪公立大学 shiiin9 improves to 52.92 but finishes nineteenth as the field moves around it. Higher up, Dawid Kopiczko’s recorded increase to 67.22 puts the entry eighth, ahead of Domdolus Tolus. ibyyue holds tenth at 65.56 after the advance covered in yesterday’s Late edition; that is continuing context, not a new overnight gain. mtg’s recorded improvement to 46.67 carried it to twenty-second during the night, but it closes twenty-fourth."
